### List proposal templates
GET http://localhost:8099/api/demo/db-action-registry/templates

### Propose a read action
POST http://localhost:8099/api/demo/db-action-registry/proposals/ticket.lookup

### Approve the returned proposal id
POST http://localhost:8099/api/demo/db-action-registry/proposals/{{proposalId}}/approve

### Discover DB and runtime actions
GET http://localhost:8099/api/demo/db-action-registry/discovery

### Execute a registered read action
POST http://localhost:8099/api/demo/db-action-registry/execute/ticket.lookup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "params": {
    "ticketId": "TCK-1001"
  },
  "confirmed": false,
  "userId": "agent-1"
}

### Propose and approve escalation before this call
POST http://localhost:8099/api/demo/db-action-registry/execute/ticket.escalate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "params": {
    "ticketId": "TCK-1001",
    "targetQueue": "platform-sre"
  },
  "confirmed": false,
  "userId": "agent-1"
}

### Confirm escalation
POST http://localhost:8099/api/demo/db-action-registry/execute/ticket.escalate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "params": {
    "ticketId": "TCK-1001",
    "targetQueue": "platform-sre"
  },
  "confirmed": true,
  "userId": "agent-1"
}

### Raw DB registry endpoint, API-key protected
GET http://localhost:8099/api/ai/actions/registry
X-AIFABRIC-REGISTRY-KEY: local-registry-key

### Deregister an action
DELETE http://localhost:8099/api/demo/db-action-registry/actions/ticket.lookup
